  <div class="pl-cards">
    <details class="pl-card-d">
      <summary>FirestoreBackupService.kt — add batchRestoreArticleTags()</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>Add <code>RESTORE_TAG_CHUNK_SIZE = 10</code> constant and <code>suspend fun batchRestoreArticleTags(articleIds: List&lt;String&gt;): Map&lt;String, List&lt;ArticleTags&gt;&gt;</code>. Uses <code>coroutineScope { }</code> + <code>async { }</code> + <code>awaitAll()</code> to dispatch up to 10 subcollection reads in parallel per chunk. Existing <code>restoreArticleTags(articleId)</code> is unchanged (still used by single-article <code>restoreArticle</code>).</p>
